{"id":"ccbf8f0ef5d3cfe6","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-C-random-not-strong-K.md","title":"C-Random Strings with Unbounded Strong K Deficiency","display":"thm-C-random-not-strong-K — C-Random Strings with Unbounded Strong K Deficiency","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-C-random-not-strong-K","aliases":["43-thm-C-random-not-strong-K"],"display":"thm-C-random-not-strong-K — C-Random Strings with Unbounded Strong K Deficiency","depends_on":["[[43-df-incompressible]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 7.3.7 and Corollary 7.3.8","source_printed_pages":"125–128","source_pdf_pages":"145–148","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-C-random-not-strong-K"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-C-random-not-strong-K</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-C-random-not-strong-K — C-Random Strings with Unbounded Strong K Deficiency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6f984600c044f352\" href=\"?note=6f984600c044f352\" title=\"43-df-incompressible\">43-df-incompressible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 7.3.7 and Corollary 7.3.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"125–128"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"145–148"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>；自然数参数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 编码。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incompressible}\">\\(\\mathrm{Incompressible}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6f984600c044f352\" href=\"?note=6f984600c044f352\" title=\"43-df-incompressible\">43-df-incompressible</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall d,N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(|\\sigma|\\ge N\\land\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,c)\\land K(\\sigma)&lt;|\\sigma|+K(|\\sigma|)-d\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall d,N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(|\\sigma|\\ge N\\land\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,c)\\land K(\\sigma)&lt;|\\sigma|+K(|\\sigma|)-d\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定普通亏损而强 K 亏损无界；展开“本质随机”的隐含常数和无限性，避免把单个有限串的有限亏损误当成反例族。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 7.3.7 and Corollary 7.3.8；印刷页 125–128，PDF 页 145–148。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-incompressible","status":"resolved","id":"6f984600c044f352","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-incompressible]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 $\\mathrm{Incompressible}$ 见 [[43-df-incompressible]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 $\\mathrm{Incompressible}$ 见 [[43-df-incompressible]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-incompressible","status":"resolved","id":"6f984600c044f352","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 $\\mathrm{Incompressible}$ 见 [[43-df-incompressible]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Incompressible}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall d,N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(|\\sigma|\\ge N\\land\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,c)\\land K(\\sigma)<|\\sigma|+K(|\\sigma|)-d\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1579,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-C-random-not-strong-K]] — C-Random Strings with Unbounded Strong K Deficiency"}],"outgoing":["6f984600c044f352","6cd902d852c2c848","e039afac1517f3d7"]}